    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήπως</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή
			πως</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lest in any
			way</i>, and after Verbs of fearing, <i>lest perchance</i>, freq.
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, written divisim, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή πως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.396
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ τι ἴδμεν, μή πως . .
				μενοινήσωσι</span>
			<i>that</i> they will <i>not</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.101
			</span></i>.</div>
